      {
        "Id": "d598190869704ccbb7bc67b47bf6c35c",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the SHEET with the tiling plan on it (or the tiling plan), set RUN = False and run = preview (counts, nothing kept), then RUN = True.   Every room and every tile area (inner tiles, border ..) gets a room tag, START (wall / edge to first joint) + one TILE dimension in X and Y, the overall size, an FFL level and a tile note TILE A, TILE B ..   Tiles = pattern on the floor (B17 / floor material) or separate tile elements.   Run again = D12's dims / levels / notes replaced.  Ctrl+Z undoes a run.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
